https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/unprecedented-security-how-delhi-is-bracing-for-october-10-protests-against-cec/articleshow/134838757.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-09T22:08:40+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Vivek Dubey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134838967,imgsize-261170.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Nagaland explores long term partnership to boost learning in Government schools]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/nagaland-explores-long-term-partnership-to-boost-learning-in-government-schools/articleshow/134837825.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134837825.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Nagaland is teaming up with both Indian and German philanthropic groups to improve the quality of education in its government schools. The collaborative discussions have led to a proposed five-year plan, emphasizing teacher training and enhancing digital infrastructure. By involving local organizations, the initiative seeks to boost student learning outcomes and create job opportunities that encourage young individuals to remain in Nagaland.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/nagaland-explores-long-term-partnership-to-boost-learning-in-government-schools/articleshow/134837825.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/nagaland-explores-long-term-partnership-to-boost-learning-in-government-schools/articleshow/134837825.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-09T21:41:34+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Mahima Sharma</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134838243,imgsize-100628.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Repeal all assembly polls over last 2 years': INDIA bloc MPs meet President Murmu, make 4 demands]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/repeal-all-assembly-polls-over-last-2-years-india-bloc-mps-meet-president-murmu-make-4-demands/articleshow/134837955.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134837955.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/repeal-all-assembly-polls-over-last-2-years-india-bloc-mps-meet-president-murmu-make-4-demands/articleshow/134837955.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/repeal-all-assembly-polls-over-last-2-years-india-bloc-mps-meet-president-murmu-make-4-demands/articleshow/134837955.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-09T21:36:27+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Vivek Dubey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134838004,imgsize-106636.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['She didn't contest our vote chori claim, sought proof': Rahul Gandhi after meeting President Murmu]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/she-didnt-contest-our-vote-chori-claim-sought-proof-rahul-gandhi-after-meeting-president-murmu/articleshow/134837842.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134837842.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/she-didnt-contest-our-vote-chori-claim-sought-proof-rahul-gandhi-after-meeting-president-murmu/articleshow/134837842.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/she-didnt-contest-our-vote-chori-claim-sought-proof-rahul-gandhi-after-meeting-president-murmu/articleshow/134837842.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-09T21:29:31+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Subhadra Srivastava</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134837930,imgsize-129941.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Game of one-upmanship? For fourth day in a row, INDIA bloc MPs hit the streets ahead of CJP's Jantar Mantar 2.0]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/game-of-one-upmanship-for-fourth-day-in-a-row-india-bloc-mps-hit-the-streets-ahead-of-cjps-jantar-mantar-2-0/articleshow/134837332.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134837332.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[In New Delhi, opposition leaders have rallied for four straight days, demanding the resignation of Chief Election Commissioner Gyanesh Kumar. They charge the government with manipulating electoral rolls while staging protests across multiple sites. Police responses have fluctuated, at times permitting rallies and occasionally enforcing strict measures. Adding to the unrest, a youth-led organization is planning a demonstration on October 10, potentially escalating tensions and influencing the opposition's future tactics.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/game-of-one-upmanship-for-fourth-day-in-a-row-india-bloc-mps-hit-the-streets-ahead-of-cjps-jantar-mantar-2-0/articleshow/134837332.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/game-of-one-upmanship-for-fourth-day-in-a-row-india-bloc-mps-hit-the-streets-ahead-of-cjps-jantar-mantar-2-0/articleshow/134837332.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-09T21:22:17+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Kunal Varma</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134838473,imgsize-1583512.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Summons on the wall: CBI pastes notice outside residence of Punjab CM Bhagwant Mann's OSD Rajbir Ghuman]]></title><description><![CDATA[]]></de